-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",400,{
[12769]="700654BB\n1\tTalk to Kholnedák\tDingási has asked that you travel south to Arnach, and speak with Kholnedák, the supervisor in charge of the town's storage and shipping of stone. Kholnedák can be found in Arnach.\n2\tTalk to Kholnedák near the northern farms\tKholnedák has asked you to meet her near the northern farms in Arnach.\n3\tSearch Aegollant for shoddy stones\tKholnedák has asked you to investigate the bandit camp Aegollant, and to search for signs of the shoddy stones. Aegollant is in Lossarnach.\n4\tExamine the stone\tWithin the ruins of Aegollant, you have found piles of the shoddy blocks which were snuck into the dwarves' superior piles of stone. You should investigate the blocks.\n5\tReturn to Kholnedák\tWhile inspecting the shoddy stones in Aegollant, you were set upon by brigands. One of the bandits dropped a crumpled note, the details of which Kholnedák will be eager to read. Kholnedák is in Arnach.\n",
[12770]="7001817F\n1\tDefeat Ruingal\tRuingal can be found in the Forges of Khazad-dûm, south of the Cross-roads of Ash in the Flaming Deeps, east of the Water Works. Hugi has asked you to aid a fellow lore-master against the fire-grim Ruingal, in order to fulfil the Path of the Ancient Master.\n2\tTalk to Hugi at outside the Forges of Khazad-dûm\tHugi is at the camp-site outside the Forges of Khazad-dûm. You should return to Hugi and inform him of your success.\n",
[12771]="7001818B\n1\tHelp a captain complete \"In Harm's Way\"\tFil-gashan lies in the south-western reaches of the Flaming Deeps. Waden has instructed you to help a fellow captain complete his final task at the Fil-gashan.\n2\tTalk to Waden outside Fil-gashan\tWaden is just outside Fil-gashan in the south-western reaches of the Flaming Deeps. With your task complete, you should return to Waden with news of your success.\n",
[12772]="70018185\n1\tDefeat Longpincer\tLongpincer can be found in Skûmfil, east of the Shadowed Refuge in the Foundations of Stone. Assist a champion in slaying the grodbog Longpincer.\n2\tTalk to Nils at his camp\tNils is at his camp outside of Skûmfil. You should return to Nils with news of your success.\n",
[12773]="7001818E\n1\tDefeat the Mad Captain\tThe Mad Captain can only be summoned within the Dark Delvings, found in the south-eastern reaches of the Foundations of Stone. Breguthryth has asked you to help a fellow warden defeat the Mad Captain.\n2\tTalk to Breguthryth outside the Dark Delvings\tBreguthryth is outside the Dark Delvings. You should return to Breguthryth with tidings of your success.\n",
[12774]="70018190\n1\tDefeat Unur\tThe Sixteenth Hall lies north from the Foundations of Stone and south of Sigin-Tharâk. Hardsnel has instructed you to help a fellow Burglar complete his or her final task at the Sixteenth Hall.\n2\tTalk to Hardsnel\tHardsnel is just outside the Sixteenth Hall, north of the Foundations of Stone. With Unur slain, you should return to Hardsnel with news of your success.\n",
[12775]="70018194\n1\tDefeat Drâgh\tThe Grand Stair lies just north from the camp where you met Eniel. Eniel has instructed you to help a fellow Hunter complete his or her final task at the Grand Stair.\n2\tReturn to Eniel\tEniel is at the camp-site just south from the Grand Stair. With the leader of the White Hand slain, you should return to Eniel.\n",
[12776]="7005B51A\n1\tTalk to Rúni\tLore-master Rúni is located in Bazanmanar. Mother Amma has asked you to speak to Lore-master Rúni.\n2\tInvestigate the drakes at Frósthel\tDrakes can be found in north-west Clovengap. There may drakes to which the corruption has spread. Rúni has asked you to investigate.\n3\tDefeat crystal-encrusted drakes (total: 6)\030Defeat the cold-drake nest matron\tDrakes can be found in Frósthel, in north-west Clovengap. The sarrowstone enchantment has infected the drakes. You must defeat them lest the corruption spread!\n4\tReturn to Mother Amma\tMother Amma is in Bazanmanar, in the north-east Clovengap. You should tell Mother Amma what you found in the ruins of Frósthel.\n5\tTalk to Rúni\tLore-master Rúni is in Bazanmanar, in the north-east Clovengap. Mother Amma has asked you to see what progress Rúni has made.\n",
[12777]="70049550\n1\tFind the rear pathway onto Lûghash\030Find the trail of crystal lamps\030Find the hidden gate of Lûghash upon the parapet\tThe hidden gate of Lûghash can be found in an alcove high above the main gate, accessible by a rear pathway leading onto the Spire. Spakorth has described the path to the hidden gate of Lûghash. You should find the rear pathway, climb the tower by following the path of crystal lamps, and seek the hidden gate in a shadowed alcove.\n2\tEnter the hidden gate of Lûghash and find Spakorth\tThe hidden gate of Lûghash can be found in an alcove high above the main gate, accessible by a rear pathway leading onto the Spire. You have discovered the hidden gate of Lûghash and should now enter the Flaming Spire and find Spakorth.\n3\tTalk to Spakorth in Lûghash\tSpakorth can be found in the dwarf-barracks on the central level of Lûghash. You have entered Lûghash and should now speak to Spakorth.\n",
[12778]="70019945\n1\tTalk to a Galadhrim Guard outside Caras Galadhon\tThe Galadhrim Guard outside Caras Galadhon is waiting to speak to you.\n",
[12779]="70028C9B\n1\tDefeat Dunlending patrols (total: 5)\tDunlending patrols can be found in the valleys and mountain passes south of Garrun's camp. Garrun asked you to engage the Dunlending patrols along the western edge of the Isendale and clear a path to Wulf's Cleft.\n2\tTalk to Garrun in the Isendale\tGarrun is encamped to the north of Cuvnerth. You should return to Garrun and let him know that any Dunlending patrols have been scattered.\n",
[12780]="7005AB14\n1\tComplete quests in the Welkin-lofts for Dréri and Náth (total: 4)\tHórin has asked you to help Dréri and Náth prepare the camp for incoming reinforcements. You should complete quests for Dréri and Náth.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tFellgát has been cleaned up and is ready for more dwarves. You should talk to Hórin in Fellgát.\n",
[12781]="70072515\n1\tSpeak with Bêtam the Couth at Jiret-menêsh\tMake your way to Jiret-menêsh and speak with Bêtam the Couthful. He, or one of his kin will surely have details on where the hidden citadel may be.\n2\tRetrieve the hammer from Kojomedên's corpse\tBêtam explained that he will provide you a map for the price of collecting a prized smith's hammer from the resting place of Kojomedên in the Quelling-house. He warned that others fear to enter to the place due to horrors wrought there.\n3\tDeliver Kojomedên's hammer to Bêtam the Couth in Jiret-menêsh\tYou claimed the hammer from the despoiled corpse of a once great dwarf artisan. Return Kojomedên's hammer to Bêtam the Couth at Jiret-menêsh. If he is an honourable dwarf, he will provide you with the information you seek.\n",
[12782]="7002F846\n1\tHelp Wuscrad, the garrison commander\030Help Baldthorne, the blacksmith\030Help Elfwyn, the healer\030Help Adnoth, the stable-hand\tThane Mildrith's people are located within the walls of Elthengels in the eastern section of the Norcrofts. Thane Mildrith has asked you to aid her people in their tasks of protecting the town from further attack.\n2\tReturn to Thane Mildrith at the Mead Hall of Elthengels\tThane Mildrith is found at the Mead Hall of Elthengels. Thane Mildrith has promised to reward you for helping her people with their various tasks.\n",
[12783]="7004DD86\n1\tTalk to Fosco Farfield\030Talk to Will Whitfoot\tTalk to Farmer Fosco Farfield and Mayor Will Whitfoot.\n2\tGather up the picnic supplies.\t\n3\tLoad Penny with the picnic supplies\tPack your supplies on Penny.\n4\tReach the stream and cool off\030Thwart chatty hobbits\tReach the stream with Penny and cool off. Don't get caught up by any chatty hobbits. They'll only slow you down! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tCool off at the next watering hole\030Pick carrots for Penny (total: 8)\tReach the watering hole with Penny and get some more relief from the heat. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tFeed Penny some carrots\tFeed Penny some carrots.\n7\tReach the perfect picnic spot\030Remove distracting clover from the path\tReach the perfect picnic spot with Penny. The clover along the way might distract her and cause a delay! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tUnpack the pony\tYou have reached the picnic spot and found Will Whitfoot waiting. Time to unpack the picnic things and lay out the feast!\n9\tHave a picnic on the picnic blanket\030Thwart hungry hobbits with a light slap\tHave a picnic on the picnic blanket. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tHave a lovely picnic with not a single interruption.\t\n",
[12784]="7004DD87\n1\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\"\t\n",
[12785]="7004DD81\n1\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\" in a raid group\tComplete \"The Perfect Picnic\" in a raid group.\n",
[12786]="700613DB\n1\tTalk to Frothard Took\030Talk to Henepa Twistknot\030Talk to Postman Hartclover\tAsk around Tighfield for opinions on what makes a good mathom.\n2\tTalk to Tílsa Hardstep\tTílsa Hardstep can be found on the outskirts of Tighfield. Return to Tílsa Hardstep.\n",
[12787]="70044E46\n1\tTalk to Bingo inside his hobbit-hole to prepare for the party\tBingo is inside his hobbit-hole in Michel Delving, north of the Town Hole.\n2\tTalk to Bingo outside his home in Michel Delving\tBingo is outside his hobbit-hole in Michel Delving, north of the Town Hole. Bingo's dinner party was a rousing success, and he wishes to thank you for all your help.\n",
[12788]="700582D9\n1\tExamine the strange rock\tA strange rock can be found near where Fram's map end. You should examine the strange rock.\n2\tTalk to Léothred\tLéothred can be found following Fram's map in Elderslade. You should talk to Léothred.\n",
[12789]="7004E72C\n1\tSet out on the path to Stormwall\tThe path to Stormwall is north-east of Skarháld. You should set out on the path to Stormwall, keeping an eye out for the five Zhélruka.\n2\tInteract with Slain Zhélruka\tThe path to Stormwall is north-east of Skarháld. You continue on the path to Stormwall, keeping an eye out for the missing Zhélruka.\n3\tFind the missing Zhélruka (3/4)\tThe path to Stormwall is north-east of Skarháld. You continue on the path to Stormwall, keeping an eye out for the missing Zhélruka.\n",
[12790]="70072518\n1\tBring the map to Valukhâri in Zajâna\tBêtam provided you a map and directed you to compare it to the maps in the library of Zajâna. He warned that where the edges do not match, there shall you find the Fool King's citadel.\n",
[12791]="7006C5CE\n1\tSpeak with the Tale-warden Mashêm\030Speak with the Tale-warden Shulêga\tKizeri, the leader of the Tale-wardens, asked you to visit and introduce yourself to the other members of her order, Mashêm and Shulêga. Each are located close to Kizeri in the shadow of Telperiën's Wall.\n2\tTalk to Kizeri\tReturn to Kizeri, the leader of the Tale-wardens, and tell her you have introduced yourself to her assistants at Telperiën's wall.\n",
[12792]="70007862\n1\tUse Gooseberry Pie\030Use Apple Pie\030Use Blackberry Pie\030Use Rhubarb Pie\tEat six pies within the allotted amount of time.\n2\tUse Gooseberry Pie\030Use Apple Pie\030Use Blackberry Pie\030Use Rhubarb Pie\tEat five more pies within the allotted amount of time.\n3\tUse Gooseberry Pie\030Use Apple Pie\030Use Blackberry Pie\030Use Rhubarb Pie\tEat four more pies within the allotted amount of time.\n4\tUse Gooseberry Pie\030Use Apple Pie\030Use Blackberry Pie\030Use Rhubarb Pie\tEat three more pies within the allotted amount of time.\n5\tUse Gooseberry Pie\030Use Apple Pie\030Use Blackberry Pie\030Use Rhubarb Pie\tEat two more pies within the allotted amount of time.\n6\tUse Gooseberry Pie\030Use Apple Pie\030Use Blackberry Pie\030Use Rhubarb Pie\tEat one more within the allotted amount of time.\n7\tTalk to Humbert Sandheaver\tStuffed and sticky with pie, you should now speak to the Pie-man.\n",
[12793]="70026079\n1\tTalk to Albin Northcotton\tAlbin Northcotton is at the market-grounds at the Northcotton Farm. Albin Northcotton will be pleased to hear the pipe-weed is ready.\n",
[12794]="700290BE\n1\tThe banner is on the arena floor at Avardin in the Starkmoor. Use the banner to summon forth your first opponents, then defeat them.\t\n2\tTalk to Geralht at the Culling Pit in Avardin\tGeralht is at the Culling Pit in Avardin. Geralht will be pleased to discuss your victory.\n",
[12795]="700290BF\n1\tThe banner is on the arena floor at Avardin in the Starkmoor. Use the banner to summon forth your first opponents, then defeat them.\t\n2\tTalk to Geralht at the Culling Pit in Avardin\tGeralht is at the Culling Pit in Avardin. Geralht will be pleased to discuss your victory.\n",
[12796]="700290C0\n1\tDefeat the giant Gethin\tThe banner is on the arena floor at Avardin in the Starkmoor. Use the banner to summon forth your first opponents, then defeat them.\n2\tTalk to Geralht at the Culling Pit in Avardin\tGeralht is at the Culling Pit in Avardin. Geralht will be pleased to discuss your victory.\n",
[12797]="700290C1\n1\tThe banner is on the arena floor at Avardin in the Starkmoor. Use the banner to summon forth your first opponents, then defeat them.\t\n2\tTalk to Geralht at the Culling Pit in Avardin\tGeralht is at the Culling Pit in Avardin. Geralht will be pleased to discuss your victory.\n",
[12798]="7002BA54\n1\tFind some sign of Ondor\tYou should see if you can discover any sign of Ondor the Dwarf near the entrance to the Pit of Iron in the north-east Heathfells.\n",
[12799]="7005AAB5\n1\tTalk to Klúso\030Talk to Kyrstig\030Talk to Molkha\tScout-master Ausma has asked you to introduce yourself to her apprentices. You should talk to Kyrstig, Molkha, and Klúso in Bárgstad.\n2\tTalk to Scout-master Ausma\tNow that you have met the new scouts, you should decide upon your course of action in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should talk to Scout-master Ausma in Bárgstad.\n3\tFind Shakhajât\030Help Scout-master Ausma with \"Just a Warm-up\"\tSomewhere in the heart of the Stonejaws is the hobgoblin fort Shakhajât. You should find Shakhajât and help Ausma with \"Just a Warm-up\".\n4\tTalk to Scout-master Ausma\tYou have located the hobgoblin fort in the Pit of Stonejaws. You should talk to Scout-master Ausma in Bárgstad.\n",
[12800]="700494BD\n1\tTalk to Párgrub\tYou should talk to Párgrub.\n2\tTalk to Párgrub\tPárgrub can be found near Thorzhaf. You should speak with Párgrub about the match.\n",
})
